menu "Quadrature Encoder"
	menuconfig DRIVERS_QUADRATURE_ENCODER
		bool "Quadrature Encoder Driver"
		default n
		---help---
			Enable support for GPIO interrupt-based quadrature encoder driver.

			This high-performance driver reads quadrature encoders without
			requiring hardware timer peripherals, making it suitable for
			applications where timer resources are limited.

			Features:
			- Multi-instance support (up to 4 encoders)
			- Digital filtering for noise immunity
			- Real-time velocity calculation
			- Comprehensive error detection
			- Thread-safe operation

endmenu
